{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43292","headline":"浊水求珠 · 吕价","name":"浊水求珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝诚难得，潜光在浊流。\n深沈当处晦，皎洁庶来求。\n缀履将还用，褰裳必更收。\n蚌胎应自别，鱼目岂能俦。\n日彩逢高鉴，星光讵暗投。\n不因今日取，泥滓出无由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}